{
  "version": "0.2",
  "_readme": "Allowlist for scripts/petri_audit/sanitizer.py: the projection of a raw Inspect .eval log that may enter the public repository (docs/petri_integration_design.md section 9). Anything not named here is removed and counted in the manifest's redaction report. The raw log is never committed; it is bound to the manifest by sha256 and held under the custody the manifest records. Keys listed under forbidden_keys are refused anywhere in the output, allowlist or not, as a second line of defence. Data, not code: a change here is a new sanitiser allowlist version and a new allowlist digest in every manifest that used it.",
